rkins-4-starters-returning-ole-miss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest's post-blowout jab at SMU tops college football Week 11 trolls","description":"Wake Forest dominated SMU on the gridiron Saturday -- and added insult to injury after the game.","published":"2026-11-15T04:43:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50481104/college-football-trolls-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the winningest college football coaches of all time?","description":"From Saban to Paterno, there are many legendary college football coaches. Who has the best career record? Check out who has the most wins now.","published":"2026-11-15T04:25:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/39283806/who-winningest-college-football-coaches-all","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Louisville holds off UNC in game that ends with brawl","description":"Louisville held off North Carolina 16-14 on Saturday night in a game that ended in a brawl and each of the teams having to be separated.","published":"2026-11-15T04:28:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486992/louisville-holds-unc-game-ends-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kentucky's CFP hopes take hit in upset loss to Gators, Philo","description":"Florida quarterback Aaron Philo had 221 all-purpose yards and a touchdown to rally the Gators past No. 11 Kentucky 21-14 Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T04:13:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486400/kentucky-cfp-hopes-take-hit-upset-loss-gators-philo","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 24 Boise State outlasts Oregon State, to host Pac-12 title game","description":"Rasean Jones caught 11 passes for 230 yards and 3 TDs to help No. 24 Boise State outlast Oregon State 46-41 and wrap up the host spot in the Pac-12 title game.","published":"2026-11-15T03:30:08.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50486399/boise-state-outlasts-oregon-state-host-pac-12-title-game","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No. 16 Oregon keeps CFP hopes alive with win over Michigan","description":"Dylan Raiola threw for 341 yards and four touchdowns, and No. 16 Oregon kept its slim chances for a spot in the College Football Playoff alive with a victory over struggling Michigan on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:15:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485510/no16-oregon-keeps-cfp-hopes-alive-win-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Grant Wilson delivers as Indiana boosts CFP, Big Ten hopes with win vs. USC","description":"With Grant Wilson filling in at quarterback, No. 9 Indiana ramped up its offensive attack against USC and scored its best win of the season Saturday.","published":"2026-11-15T03:22:32.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50485076/grant-wilson-indiana-boost-cfp-big-ten-hopes-win-vs-usc","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Watch best moments and top plays live from Week 11","published":"2026-11-15T01:00:42.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50474063/week-11-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Darian Mensah dices up ex-team Duke as Miami rebounds from first loss","description":"Miami quarterback Darian Mensah diced up his former team Saturday, finishing with 382 yards and a touchdown in the 36-25 victory over Duke.","published":"2026-11-14T23:57:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50484151/darian-mensah-dices-ex-team-duke-miami-rebounds-first-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218778/will-echoles","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Will_Echoles"},"pick":{"pick":14,"round":1,"team":"BAL","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Will Echoles","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Will_Echoles","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"William Jamierous Echoles (born August 7, 2006) is an American college football defensive tackle for the Ole Miss Rebels.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Echoles attended Houston High School in Houston, Mississippi, where he played both defensive and offensive line. As a senior, he was the 4A Mississippi Mr. Football and 4A MHSAA Defensive Player of the Year after recording 59 tackles and seven sacks. Echoles was selected to play in the 2024 All-American Bowl. He committed to the University of Mississippi (Ole Miss) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Ole Miss in 2024, Echoles appeared in eight games and had nine tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Ole Miss as a starter his sophomore year in 2025."}]}}